OL,3,ARiyadh airport hit by second strike in
OL,4,Atwo days, Saudi-led coalition says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA strike has caused a fire at Riyadh
OL,7,Fairport, a day after 12 people were
OL,8,Fkilled in a previous attack
OL,10,F"An unknown projectile" hit a passenger
OL,11,Fhall at King Khalid International
OL,12,FAirport, the Saudi-led coalition says -
OL,13,Fair defences separately intercepted a
OL,14,Fcruise missile near the airport
OL,16,FIt comes after Yemen's Houthis warned
OL,17,Faviation firms and passengers against
OL,18,Fusing Saudi airports and airspace
OL,20,FMore than 300 were injured in
OL,21,FSaturday's attack - verified footage
OL,22,Fcaptures the aftermath of the strike
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
