OL,3,ARiyadh airport hit by second strike in
OL,4,Atwo days, Saudi-led coalition says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Houthi statement on Sunday did not
OL,7,Freference Saturday's attack - but the
OL,8,FIran-backed group said they were behind
OL,9,Fseparate strikes on the same airport on
OL,10,FThursday
OL,12,FUK Defence Secretary Wes Streeting
OL,13,Fsuggests the UK could "potentially"
OL,14,Fprovide more support for Saudi Arabia
OL,15,Fwhile US President Donald Trump says
OL,16,Fthe US may get involved in offensive
OL,17,Fstrikes
